msgstr ""
"La QFT peut-elle être utilisée sur un état qui n'est pas un état de base "
"computationnel ? Si oui, que se passe-t-il ?\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"How does the number of control qubits used in QPE affect the resolution of "
"the resulting phase estimate?\n"
msgstr ""
"Comment le nombre de qubits de contrôle utilisés dans la QPE affecte-t-il la"
" résolution de l'estimation de phase résultante ?\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Problems {#problems}"
msgstr "Problèmes {#problems}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use matrix multiplication to verify that the steps in the QFT algorithm "
"indeed result in the $\\text{QFT}_4$ matrix:\n"
msgstr ""
"Utilise la multiplication matricielle pour vérifier que les étapes de "
"l'algorithme QFT donnent bien la matrice $\\text{QFT}_4$ :\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\text{QFT}_4 = \\frac{1}{2}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"    1 & 1 & 1 & 1 \\\\\n"
"    1 & i & -1 & -i \\\\\n"
"    1 & -1 & 1 & -1 \\\\\n"
"    1 & -i & -1 & i \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\text{QFT}_4 = \\frac{1}{2}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"    1 & 1 & 1 & 1 \\\\\n"
"    1 & i & -1 & -i \\\\\n"
"    1 & -1 & 1 & -1 \\\\\n"
"    1 & -i & -1 & i \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "(You don't have to do this by hand!)\n"
msgstr "(Tu n'as pas besoin de le faire à la main !)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Challenge problems {#challenge-problems}"
msgstr "Problèmes de défi {#challenge-problems}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Make a four-qubit state that is an equal superposition of all odd "
"computational bases: $|\\psi\\rangle = |0001\\rangle + |0011\\rangle + "
"|0101\\rangle + |0111\\rangle +|1001\\rangle +|1011\\rangle +|1101\\rangle "
"+|1111\\rangle$. Then perform a QFT on the state. What is the resulting "
"state? Explain why your result makes sense, using your knowledge of Fourier "
"transforms.\n"
msgstr ""
"Crée un état à quatre qubits qui est une superposition égale de toutes les "
"bases computationnelles impaires : $|\\psi\\rangle = |0001\\rangle + "
"|0011\\rangle + |0101\\rangle + |0111\\rangle +|1001\\rangle +|1011\\rangle "
"+|1101\\rangle +|1111\\rangle$. Ensuite, effectue une QFT sur l'état. Quel "
"est l'état résultant ? Explique pourquoi ton résultat est cohérent, en "
"utilisant tes connaissances des transformées de Fourier.\n"
